Package: tennisages
Title: Retrieve and Plot Tennis Players' Career Matches by Age
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Brianna", "Jordan", , "briannajordan@berkeley.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads the career match history of a tennis player from
    tennisabstract.com and plots the player's age against the age
    difference with each opponent.
